	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02gym0202_leader2_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんだい　なんだい！▼
わかいんだから　えんりょ　なんか
しなくたって　いいのにさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:44:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんだい　なんだい！▼
若いんだから　遠慮なんか
しなくたって　いいのにさ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:43:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・終了
　再度会話はleader2_02から
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
