	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02gym0202_leader2_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふたのカセキ　なんだね！
いい　チョイスじゃないか！▼
そいつを　ふくげん　するなら
うちの　うけつけに　たのむと　いいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ふたのカセキ　なんだね！
いい　チョイスじゃないか！▼
そいつを　復元するなら
うちの　受付に　頼むと　いいよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T11:40:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
